# The Dockerfile builds everything via `git clone` — the build context needs nothing
# but the Dockerfile itself. Exclude docs/CI so the context stays tiny.
#
# ONE EXCEPTION (vibe-ic#768): tools/pdk/ holds the PDK post-install patch the
# build applies to the prebuilt ciel volume. It cannot come from `git clone` —
# it patches THIS repo's own shipped artefact — and inlining it in a RUN heredoc
# would put the logic somewhere no test can import. Excluding everything under
# tools/ except that one directory keeps the context tiny.
*
!Dockerfile
!tools
tools/*
!tools/pdk
